# Depth Anything V2 has no PyPI distribution: `pose/depth_estimator.py` imports
# `depth_anything_v2.dpt` from this source checkout, and its ImportError points
# users at this directory's requirements.txt. The checkout is therefore the
# installation mechanism for that optional legacy feature, not a convenience
# copy, so the pin is recorded properly here.
#
# Owner: pose/depth_estimator.py (LEGACY/OPTIONAL — not part of Frame Pose
# Layer A; see Architecture_v3_FramePose.md section 13).
[submodule "third_party/Depth-Anything-V2"]
	path = third_party/Depth-Anything-V2
	url = https://github.com/DepthAnything/Depth-Anything-V2.git
